  "answer": "This feature request has been filed before. The original is PowerToys#47268, and many later reports were closed as duplicates of it, including #47625, #47664, #47674 and #48038. Today, dragging a window with Grab and Move (Alt or Win) does not trigger FancyZones. Holding Shift, or having Shift activation turned off, makes no difference, so the window can't be dropped into a zone. The archive shows no fix or workaround. For now, drag the window by its title bar to snap it into a zone. To support the request, add a thumbs-up or a comment on #47268 rather than opening a new ticket."
